#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "10 sections of increasing difficulty. Destroy bridges to advance. "
msgstr "10 sections de difficulté croissante. Détruisez les ponts pour avancer."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/features.ex:1833
